@startuml
' Lecturer Support Agent — editable PlantUML source
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title Assessment Moderation
actor Lecturer
actor Moderator
participant UI
participant "Review Service" as Review
participant Authorization as Auth
participant "Version Service" as Version
participant Audit
Lecturer -> UI : submit assessment version
UI -> Review : create assignment
Moderator -> UI : open assigned assessment
UI -> Auth : verify assignment scope
Auth --> UI : allowed
UI -> Review : load immutable submitted version
Review --> UI : package and criteria
Moderator -> UI : submit findings
UI -> Review : store findings
Review --> Lecturer : notify return/recommendation
Lecturer -> UI : revise assessment
UI -> Version : create child version
Version -> Audit : link revision to findings
@enduml
